{
    "title": "AlphaNovel \u2014 Books & Stories",
    "description": "AlphaNovel is the best reading experience for novel lovers! Download AlphaNovel and enter the world with the best romantic books and novels worthy of your attention. Read novels and romance stories online, anytime and anywhere. Daily updates, ongoing books, free first chapters, and the best content for novel fans.\r\n\r\n<b>The best reading experience!</b>\r\nAlphaNovel creates a world for novel readers where everyone would find a story to their taste. Start reading for free and add your favorite books to the library! Check out the best romance stories and enjoy your experience with AlphaNovel.\r\n\r\n- Thousands of books in various genres\r\n- Exclusive books and novels from talented authors\r\n- Best books recommendations based on your interests\r\n- Easy search, Top charts, and highlighted categories\r\n- Daily challenges\r\n- Free bonuses\r\n- Weekly contest\r\n- First book chapters for free\r\n\r\n<b>Various book genres!</b>\r\nDiscover new stories and books every day in any genre you love. Collect bonuses, participate in challenges, and open new chapters!\r\n\r\n- Romance stories\r\n- Paranormal\r\n- Werewolf\r\n- Vampire\r\n- Billionaire Romance\r\n- YA / Teen\r\n- Fantasy\r\n- Mystery\r\n- Alpha\r\n\r\nWe gather novel lovers, readers, and writers in a community where you can discuss your favorite books and share your impressions with the writer!\r\n\r\n- Leave comments to the books and chapters in the app\r\n- Become a part of the AlphaNovel community on Facebook\r\n\r\nWe value our authors and community, and believe that every writer should get the promotion. Millions of readers are looking for the best books to enjoy every day. AlphaNovel gathers the most talented authors, helping them develop and get a stable income with the best writing experience.\r\n\r\n<b>Popular AlphaNovel Books:</b>\r\n\ud83d\udd25 The Alpha\u2019s Mate Who Cried Wolf\r\n\ud83d\udd25 The Alpha King\u2019s Hated Slave\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Her Forbidden Alpha\r\n\ud83d\udd25 The CEO Alpha King\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Their Forced Luna\r\n\r\n<b>How to Contact Us:</b>\r\n1. Customer Service Email \u2192 support@alphanovel.io\r\n2. Facebook \u2192 https://www.facebook.com/alphanovel.official\r\n\r\n<b>Follow Us:</b>\r\n1. Official Website \u2192 https://alphanovel.io/\r\n2. Facebook \u2192 https://www.facebook.com/alphanovel.official\r\n3. Instagram \u2192 https://www.instagram.com/alphanovel_official\r\n\r\nBy signing up for a subscription, you agree to our terms of use and privacy policy. Please check out the following information: \r\n\r\nTerms of Use \u2192 https://alphanovel.io/terms-of-use\r\nPrivacy Policy \u2192 https://alphanovel.io/privacy-policy",
